    "note": "Departure filters and complete counter snapshots use last-known characteristics and controller before the actual move, including simultaneous source departure. Counter quantities are put through the ordinary replacement batch, with new counter timestamps. Artifact-creature animation preserves prior types, colors and abilities under CR205.1b. Noncreature-only animation checks after counter placement. Pizza Face may target another artifact or creature of either player; The Ooze may target a card in either graveyard."
